          "description": "Rolling cross-asset correlation: BTC vs Gold, DXY, Nasdaq, S&P500, 10Y Treasury yield, EUR/USD, oil, VIX, and any other Yahoo Finance symbol. Returns Pearson correlation (full period + rolling window) with trend and interpretation. No API key required.",
